            <ArticleTitle>[Determinants of risk of the development of erectile dysfunction in the Russian Federation: analysis of epidemiological studies].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-31</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>According to the results of epidemiological studies of prevalence of erectile dysfunction in the Russian Federation, the search for the determinants of risk of its development was performed. It was found that the leading risk factors for the development of erectile dysfunction, in descending order of statistical significance, include the amount of accumulation of points according to the IPSS score, arterial hypertension, L(IPSS) quality of life index, age, diabetes, and overweight and obesity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
